Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libasound2 | libasound2t64, libnss3, libatk1.0-0 | libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0 | libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libcups2 | libcups2t64, libdrm2, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libgbm1
Installed-Size: 345000
Description: Subway Surfers with Verified Automatic Save System (Linux Fixed Release)
 Subway Surfers World Tour: San Francisco packaged for Linux with
 an event-driven automatic save system. Saves progress seamlessly on
 run completion, character unlocks, upgrades, and window closing.
 Fixes save persistence race conditions, IDBFS timestamp tracking,
 and atomic file rename commit hooks.
 Preserves original BSON + SHA-1 integrity header architecture.
 Original AppImage foundation by Drizzle (AppImageHub).
